CREATED:20260402T014229Z
DESCRIPTION:🎬  Come join AISCI for The AI Doc watch party this Sunday! We'
 ll be carpooling to Irvine Spectrum Center to watch the new documentary The
  AI Doc: Or How I Became an Apocaloptimist! RSVP required\, but no backgrou
 nd in AI safety needed!<br><br>🎟️  Tickets are FREE (paid for by AISCI)!<b
 r><br>📍  Irvine Spectrum Center<br>🕚  Sunday\, April 5 at 12:55 PM<br><br
 >🔗  RVSP HERE: <a href="https://forms.gle/TerA3iKqNcwFLVt49">https://forms
 .gle/TerA3iKqNcwFLVt49</a> (open to all!)<br><br>▶️  View trailer here: <a 
 href="https://youtu.be/xkPbV3IRe4Y">https://youtu.be/xkPbV3IRe4Y</a><br><br
 >Note: if carpooling\, please be ready for pick up by 12:15 PM
LAST-MODIFIED:20260402T014229Z
LOCATION:Irvine Spectrum Center\, Irvine\, CA 92618\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:AI Documentary Watch Party!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
